 tree if I'm holding a hatchet? Hey, are you a genius or what?"],"jaJP":["不可能を可能にする、それがアタシの忍術"]},"keys":["Voice_ninja_leader_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_ninja_leader_TouchReactionGood2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/614/6140032@5249123913141785767"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/614/6140032"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/614/6140032@9209944138946177104"]},"audioName":"6140032"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["米可，你在哪里啊？喵？我在问你呢，你到底在哪里！唉，又跑哪儿去了？！哎呀，烦死了！"],"enUS":["Mikke, where are you? Meow? Oh, for crying out loud, where are you! Ugh!"],"jaJP":["ミケーどこにいるのー？にゃぁ～ってば！どこにいるの？早く出てきて！"]},"keys":["Voice_ninja_leader_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_ninja_leader_TouchReactionBad1"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/614/6140033@-7475564443782698252"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/614/6140033"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/614/6140033@3166360935758780982"]},"audioName":"6140033"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["哎，少来烦我！难道你对我感兴趣？"],"enUS":["Quit bothering me! What, you got a thing for me or something?"],"jaJP":["ちょっと、鬱陶しいんだけど！もしかして、アタシに興味あるわけ？"]},"keys":["Voice_ninja_leader_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_ninja_leader_TouchReactionBad2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/614/6140034@395204498023355769"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/614/6140034"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/614/6140034@5331339200074548006"]},"audioName":"6140034"},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["书信中有提到新任务？那还等什么，快走吧。"],"enUS":["Is this the letter with my new mission? Sweet, let’s get moving."],"jaJP":["新しい任務でも届いたの？だったら、さっさととりかかろう","新しい任務でも届いたの？だったら、さっさと取り掛かろう"]},"keys":["Voice_ninja_leader_1_NoticeMail","cv_ninja_leader_NoticeMail"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/614/6140035@-719510322291631248"],"